        "font_size": 12.0,
        "raw_text": "This paper is included in the Proceedings of the 33rd USENIX Security Symposium. August 14-16, 2024 • Philadelphia, PA, USA 978-1-939133- 4 4 -1 Open access to the Proceedings of the 33rd USENIX Security Symposium is sponsored by USENIX.",
